{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-4789-a0b1-c2d3e4f56789",
    "name": "TCSS-460 Message API - Comprehensive Tests",
    "description": "Complete test suite for the TCSS-460 Message API including public and protected endpoints, validation tests, and error handling.\n\n**Setup Instructions:**\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Create an environment with variable `baseUrl` set to `http://localhost:8000`\n3. Run 'Generate API Key' request first to get authentication token\n4. The API key will be automatically saved to environment variable `apiKey`\n5. Run requests in order or use Collection Runner for automated testing\n\n**Delay Configuration:**\n- The collection includes a `requestDelay` variable (default: 500ms)\n- This adds a delay between ALL requests when using Collection Runner\n- To change: Edit collection variables → `requestDelay` → set value in milliseconds\n- Set to 0 for no delay, 500 for half second, 1000 for 1 second, etc.\n- Critical requests (API key generation, reads after writes) have additional built-in delays\n\n**Running Tests:**\n- Individual requests: No delay applied\n- Collection Runner: Automatic delays applied between requests\n- Delays help ensure database operations complete before validation",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Collection-level delay (applies to all requests)",
          "// Set delay in milliseconds (0 = no delay, 500 = half second, 1000 = 1 second)",
          "const delayMs = pm.collectionVariables.get('requestDelay') || 0;",
          "",
          "if (delayMs > 0) {",
          "    console.log(`⏱️ Waiting ${delayMs}ms before request...`);",
          "    setTimeout(function(){}, delayMs);",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Log test results summary",
          "const testResults = pm.response.code;",
          "console.log(`✓ ${pm.info.requestName} - Status: ${testResults}`);"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "testName",
      "value": "TestUser_{{$randomInt}}",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "requestDelay",
      "value": "500",
      "type": "number",
      "description": "Delay in milliseconds between requests (0 = no delay, 500 = half second, 1000 = 1 second)"
    }
  ],
